    {
      "key": "country.sa.mentor.greeting",
      "source": "Ya marhaba wa ahlan! In our Najdi courtyard by the caravan road, every verse carries wisdom and every traveler is honored.",
      "context": "Saudi Arabia (ar-SA) fictional mentor greeting",
      "translations": {
        "ar-001": "يا مرحبا وأهلاً! في فنائنا النجدي على طريق القوافل، يحمل كل بيت شعر حكمة ويُكرم كل عابر سبيل.",
        "en-us": "Ya marhaba wa ahlan! In our Najdi courtyard by the caravan road, every verse carries wisdom and every traveler is honored."
      },
      "dialectVariant": "ar-SA",
      "arabizi": "Ya marhaba wa ahlan! Fi fina'ina il-Najdi 3ala tariq il-qawafil, kull bayt shi3r yahmil hikma."
    },
