    {
      "key": "country.om.mentor.greeting",
      "source": "Hayyakum Allah in the mountain oasis! Follow the clear sound of the falaj channel and see how water brings every garden to life.",
      "context": "Oman (ar-OM) fictional mentor greeting",
      "translations": {
        "ar-001": "حياكم الله في واحة الجبل! اتبعوا خرير مياه الفلج الصافية لنرى كيف تحيا البساتين بالعدل والتعاون.",
        "en-us": "Hayyakum Allah in the mountain oasis! Follow the clear sound of the falaj channel and see how water brings every garden to life."
      },
      "dialectVariant": "ar-OM",
      "arabizi": "Hayyakum Allah fi wahat il-jabal! Ittabi3u miyah il-falaj il-safiya."
    },
