    {
      "key": "country.bh.mentor.greeting",
      "source": "Ya hala wa marhaba in Bahrain! Let us read the archaeological layers of Dilmun at Qal'at al-Bahrain and then visit the pearling houses of Muharraq.",
      "context": "Bahrain (ar-BH) fictional mentor greeting",
      "translations": {
        "ar-001": "يا هلا ومرحبا في البحرين! يلا نقرأ طبقات تاريخ دلمون في قلعة البحرين ثم نزور بيوت اللؤلؤ في المحرق.",
        "en-us": "Ya hala wa marhaba in Bahrain! Let us read the archaeological layers of Dilmun at Qal'at al-Bahrain and then visit the pearling houses of Muharraq."
      },
      "dialectVariant": "ar-BH",
      "arabizi": "Ya hala wa marhaba fil-Bahrain! Yalla naqra tabaqat Dilmun thumma nazur buyut il-Muharraq."
    },
